  "a fleeting exchange, no more.",
  "Indeed,",
  "with no regard for any of that,",
  "the battle for the colony laser",
  "went on spreading",
  "its flames ever wider.",
  "The Nature of the AEUG",
  "The Nature of the Titans",
  "The Nature of the AEUG",
  "An army is a tool.",
  "And a tool best not had,",
  "best left unused,",
  "at that.",
  "Ideally, from the day it is built",
  "to the day it is thrown away,",
  "it never once",
  "gets its turn.",
  "An army that sees action",
  "cannot be called a good army.",
  "Even so,",
  "if there is any meaning",
  "in an army being used,",
  "it lies in protecting",
  "nonviolent, unarmed citizens.",
  "\"Protecting the people\" is,",
  "by and large, an excuse",
  "those in power use",
  "to start wars,",
  "words embarrassing",
  "even to say aloud,",
  "but in the case of the army",
  "called the AEUG alone,",
  "it was the truth.",
  "They could not bear for their",
  "sweethearts in the colonies",
  "to be killed by the Titans,",
  "nor bear for",
  "their families' livelihoods",
  "to be wrecked by the Federation's",
  "Earth supremacy--",
  "that alone made them the AEUG.",
  "There is little doubt that this",
  "was the wellspring",
  "of the silent support of the",
  "people of space living in",
  "the colonies and on the Moon.",
  "They were",
  "neither a smartly uniformed,",
  "rigorously trained",
  "elite corps,",
  "nor a band of samurai marching",
  "in lockstep behind a cause.",
  "Seen as they really were, they",
