  "in this final phase,",
  "would give them",
  "the strength to hold on.",
  "They were the ideal of an army",
  "brought to fruit for an instant,",
  "a group like a phantom.",
  "At heart, an army is a tool.",
  "Yet it is not rare for a tool",
  "to go beyond its proper role",
  "and start using people.",
  "Being ruled by one's tools,",
  "as the saying goes.",
  "The Titans were a textbook",
  "example of such a tool.",
  "By origin, they were",
  "the faithful heirs",
  "of Revil's creed:",
  "an army under strong",
  "central control, and",
  "the Federation held in hand",
