  "\"My deepest apologies.",
  " The fleet will leave the Earth",
  " Sphere till things calm down, but\"",
  "\"Lady Mineva, arrangements",
  " have been made for you",
  " to study on Earth.\"",
  "\"So I humbly ask",
  " that you set out now.\"",
  "Mineva",
  "\"I can go to Earth?\"",
  "\"Yes, by all means.\"",
  "\"Earth...",
  " Haman's thoughtfulness",
